    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VPR - The Digital Studio For Interactive Streams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live streams</strong>, <strong>interactive shows</strong>, <strong>video conferences</strong>, and <strong>presentations</strong> in your own <strong>3D studio</strong> - with <strong>webcam and capture card integration</strong>, on-screen controls and the simplest integration of digital presentation tools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compatible with:</strong> Teams | Zoom | Skype | Youtube | Twitch | OBS Studio | Animaze &amp; more  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>More features and expansions coming 2025!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059640/extras/c9c9d0ec3f9c197cac5c1d81228318df.avif?t=1741173304\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Virtual Presenter Room serves as a media hub and control center for every conceivable video conference, recording or live stream. The integrated video functions allow the user to use the output of the Virtual Presenter Room as a <strong>virtual webcam</strong> and thus into all common video conferencing systems such as <strong>Teams, Zoom, Skype, Big Blue Button</strong> etc. or for the live stream directly to <strong>YouTube, Kick</strong> or to be able to <strong>broadcast on Twitch</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the Virtual Presenter Room can also be connected to existing OBS or Streamlabs setups in input and output. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New content, modules and rooms are constantly being developed and will be offered via updates and DLCs in the future.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All media sources and webcam or capture systems are captured <strong>at a full 60 frames per second</strong> and <strong>can be displayed simultaneously</strong> in the Virtual Presenter Room. <strong>Simple multi-screen sharing without the hassle of the typical low fps screen sharing functions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 x simultaneous webcam and capture inputs (multi-camera) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 x simultaneous screen and window sharing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 x NDI inputs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 x different environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4K output resolution </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Switch between 3D camera motion and hard cuts </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3D Sticky Notes feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Web browser integration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Live video and media player integration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Integration of Power Point, PDF presentations, Miro Boards and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Integration of Teams and Zoom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>A professional chroma keyer</strong> and a quick key function for quickly keying users and guests are available via <strong>green screen</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059640/extras/8f6f3e214f6303cb54da2bda2edf0d60.avif?t=1741173304\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VPR - The Digital Studio For Interactive Streams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live streams</strong>, <strong>interactive shows</strong>, <strong>video conferences</strong>, and <strong>presentations</strong> in your own <strong>3D studio</strong> - with <strong>webcam and capture card integration</strong>, on-screen controls and the simplest integration of digital presentation tools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compatible with:</strong> Teams | Zoom | Skype | Youtube | Twitch | OBS Studio | Animaze &amp; more  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>More features and expansions coming 2025!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059640/extras/c9c9d0ec3f9c197cac5c1d81228318df.avif?t=1741173304\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Virtual Presenter Room serves as a media hub and control center for every conceivable video conference, recording or live stream. The integrated video functions allow the user to use the output of the Virtual Presenter Room as a <strong>virtual webcam</strong> and thus into all common video conferencing systems such as <strong>Teams, Zoom, Skype, Big Blue Button</strong> etc. or for the live stream directly to <strong>YouTube, Kick</strong> or to be able to <strong>broadcast on Twitch</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the Virtual Presenter Room can also be connected to existing OBS or Streamlabs setups in input and output. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New content, modules and rooms are constantly being developed and will be offered via updates and DLCs in the future.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All media sources and webcam or capture systems are captured <strong>at a full 60 frames per second</strong> and <strong>can be displayed simultaneously</strong> in the Virtual Presenter Room. <strong>Simple multi-screen sharing without the hassle of the typical low fps screen sharing functions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 x simultaneous webcam and capture inputs (multi-camera) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 x simultaneous screen and window sharing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 x NDI inputs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 x different environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4K output resolution </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Switch between 3D camera motion and hard cuts </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3D Sticky Notes feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Web browser integration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Live video and media player integration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Integration of Power Point, PDF presentations, Miro Boards and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Integration of Teams and Zoom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>A professional chroma keyer</strong> and a quick key function for quickly keying users and guests are available via <strong>green screen</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059640/extras/8f6f3e214f6303cb54da2bda2edf0d60.avif?t=1741173304\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
